  "passage": [
    {
      "id": "b-hier-c-etait-samedi",
      "fr": "Hier, c'était samedi et il faisait très beau à Paris. J'étais content parce que c'était le week-end et je n'avais pas de travail.",
      "en": "Yesterday, it was Saturday and the weather was very nice in Paris. I was happy because it was the weekend and I had no work."
    },
    {
      "id": "b-d-abord-je-me",
      "fr": "D'abord, je me suis réveillé à 8h. D'habitude, je me levais plus tard le samedi, mais ce jour-là, j'ai voulu sortir tôt parce que le temps était si beau.",
      "en": "First, I woke up at 8am. Usually, I used to get up later on Saturdays, but that day, I wanted to go out early because the weather was so nice."
    },
    {
      "id": "b-apres-mon-cafe-je",
      "fr": "Après mon café, je suis allé au Jardin du Luxembourg près de ma maison. J'aime beaucoup ce parc! Il y avait beaucoup de gens dans le jardin. C'était une belle journée.",
      "en": "After my coffee, I went to Jardin du Luxembourg near my house. I really like this park! There were many people in the garden. It was a beautiful day."
    },
    {
      "id": "img-jardin",
      "fr": "Un samedi matin au Jardin du Luxembourg.",
      "en": "A Saturday morning in the Jardin du Luxembourg.",
      "img": {
        "src": "img/reading9/jardin",
        "w": 1600,
        "h": 1067,
        "alt": "Impressionist painting of a young man in a straw hat and cream jacket walking toward the pond of the Jardin du Luxembourg, with toy sailboats, strollers and the Luxembourg Palace behind."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b-je-suis-alle-pres",
      "fr": "Je suis allé près du lac quand soudain j'ai vu mon ami Pierre. Il était assis sur un banc sous un grand arbre. Je suis allé vers lui et on a commencé à parler.",
      "en": "I went near the lake when suddenly I saw my friend Pierre. He was sitting on a bench under a big tree. I went towards him and we started talking."
    },
    {
      "id": "img-banc",
      "fr": "Pierre est assis sur un banc, sous un grand arbre.",
      "en": "Pierre is sitting on a bench under a big tree.",
      "img": {
        "src": "img/reading9/banc",
        "w": 1600,
        "h": 1067,
        "alt": "Impressionist painting of Pierre, bearded in a bowler hat, waving from a green bench under a big tree beside the pond as the narrator walks up."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b-salut-pierre-qu-est",
      "fr": "J'ai demandé: \"Salut Pierre! Qu'est-ce que tu fais ici?\"",
      "en": "I asked: \"Hi Pierre! What are you doing here?\""
    },
    {
      "id": "b-bonjour-je-voulais-etre",
      "fr": "Il a dit: \"Bonjour! Je voulais être dehors parce qu'il faisait si beau. Je suis content que tu sois là!\"",
      "en": "He said: \"Hello! I wanted to be outside because it was so nice. I'm glad you're here!\""
    },
    {
      "id": "b-nous-avons-parle-pendant",
      "fr": "Nous avons parlé pendant une heure. Pierre voulait un nouveau travail à la Sorbonne parce qu'il n'aimait pas son travail. Je le comprenais, car j'ai eu le même problème l'année dernière.",
      "en": "We talked for an hour. Pierre wanted a new job at the Sorbonne because he didn't like his job. I understood him, because I had the same problem last year."
    },
    {
      "id": "b-ensuite-comme-nous-avions",
      "fr": "Ensuite, comme nous avions faim, nous avons décidé d'aller au Café de Flore qui est en face du jardin. Le Café de Flore est très bon et très célèbre à Paris! Il y avait beaucoup de gens - à côté des fenêtres, autour des tables, partout!",
      "en": "Then, since we were hungry, we decided to go to Café de Flore which is across from the garden. Café de Flore is very good and very famous in Paris! There were many people - next to the windows, around the tables, everywhere!"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-nous-avons-commande-des",
      "fr": "Nous avons commandé des sandwichs et du café. Pendant que nous mangions, nous avons vu Marie. Elle est entrée dans le café. Elle nous a vus et elle est venue à notre table.",
      "en": "We ordered sandwiches and coffee. While we were eating, we saw Marie. She entered the café. She saw us and she came to our table."
    },
    {
      "id": "img-flore",
      "fr": "Au Café de Flore, Marie vient à notre table.",
      "en": "At Café de Flore, Marie comes to our table.",
      "img": {
        "src": "img/reading9/flore",
        "w": 1600,
        "h": 1067,
        "alt": "Impressionist painting of a crowded Paris café with red banquettes and mirrors; the narrator and Pierre look up from their coffee as Marie, in a lavender dress, arrives at their table."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b-quelle-surprise-elle-a",
      "fr": "Elle a dit: \"Quelle surprise! Je ne savais pas que vous étiez ici!\"",
      "en": "She said: \"What a surprise! I didn't know you were here!\""
    },
    {
      "id": "b-marie-etait-notre-amie",
      "fr": "Marie était notre amie de la Sorbonne. Nous ne la voyons pas souvent parce qu'elle habite maintenant à Lyon. Grâce à cette rencontre, nous avons pu être ensemble pour l'après-midi.",
      "en": "Marie was our friend from the Sorbonne. We don't see her often because she now lives in Lyon. Thanks to this meeting, we were able to be together for the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "id": "b-l-apres-midi-nous",
      "fr": "L'après-midi, nous sommes allés au cinéma près de la gare. Il y avait le film \"Amélie\" - un très bon film français! Le cinéma était à dix minutes du Café de Flore.",
      "en": "In the afternoon, we went to the cinema near the station. There was the film \"Amélie\" - a very good French film! The cinema was ten minutes from Café de Flore."
    },
    {
      "id": "b-le-film-etait-excellent",
      "fr": "Le film était excellent! Nous avons beaucoup aimé Amélie. Après le film, nous avons décidé de manger ensemble au Restaurant Le Procope qui est derrière le cinéma. Le Procope est le plus vieux restaurant de Paris!",
      "en": "The film was excellent! We really liked Amélie. After the film, we decided to eat together at Restaurant Le Procope which is behind the cinema. Le Procope is the oldest restaurant in Paris!"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-au-restaurant-nous-avons",
      "fr": "Au restaurant, nous avons mangé de la bonne cuisine française. C'était délicieux! Nous avons parlé de la Sorbonne, de nos vies, et de ce que nous voulons faire.",
      "en": "At the restaurant, we ate good French food. It was delicious! We talked about the Sorbonne, about our lives, and about what we want to do."
    },
    {
      "id": "img-procope",
      "fr": "Le soir, au Procope, le plus vieux restaurant de Paris.",
      "en": "In the evening at Le Procope, the oldest restaurant in Paris.",
      "img": {
        "src": "img/reading9/procope",
        "w": 1600,
        "h": 1067,
        "alt": "Impressionist painting of the three friends laughing at a round table in a red restaurant with chandeliers and gilt frames."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b-a-cause-du-temps",
      "fr": "À cause du temps, Marie a dû partir vers 9h pour rentrer à Lyon. Pierre et moi sommes restés un peu plus. Nous avons pris un dernier café ensemble.",
      "en": "Because of the time, Marie had to leave around 9pm to go back to Lyon. Pierre and I stayed a bit longer. We had one last coffee together."
    },
    {
      "id": "b-finalement-je-suis-rentre",
      "fr": "Finalement, je suis rentré chez moi vers 10h. J'étais fatigué mais très heureux. C'était une journée parfaite à Paris.",
      "en": "Finally, I went home around 10pm. I was tired but very happy. It was a perfect day in Paris."
    },
